                  "id": "天机录_ch0403_result_03",
                  "character_id": "char_chenji",
                  "content": "既然要做，就做彻底——把我的血脉，全部燃尽！",
                  "emotion": "决然"
                }
              }
            ],
            "is_premium": false,
